WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:02.633
Every opportunity…

00:05.200 --> 00:07.200
…begins with a conversation.

00:09.633 --> 00:11.233
Then life moves on.

00:11.600 --> 00:12.900
Details blur.

00:13.267 --> 00:14.667
Promises fade.

00:15.133 --> 00:17.767
One by one… the doors close.

00:19.333 --> 00:20.567
Not anymore.

00:20.900 --> 00:22.833
This… is Orbit.

00:24.367 --> 00:25.333
Just speak.

00:25.467 --> 00:27.333
Orbit remembers every name.

00:27.467 --> 00:28.700
Every promise.

00:28.767 --> 00:30.033
Every detail.

00:33.967 --> 00:35.100
Weeks from now.

00:35.300 --> 00:36.467
Months from now.

00:36.733 --> 00:38.133
Nothing is lost.

00:38.667 --> 00:40.500
It watches the world for you.

00:40.700 --> 00:41.867
Searches the web.

00:42.000 --> 00:42.667
News.

00:42.700 --> 00:43.900
Job postings.

00:43.933 --> 00:47.400
And tells you who to reach out to… before it's too late.

00:48.333 --> 00:51.433
It finds who you know… where you want to be.

00:53.167 --> 00:54.767
Everything you use.

00:54.967 --> 00:57.233
Finally… in one place.

00:57.967 --> 01:00.367
Your whole world of people.

01:00.733 --> 01:01.733
In view.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.600
One conversation becomes a follow-up.

01:10.867 --> 01:13.133
A follow-up… an introduction.

01:15.233 --> 01:18.333
And an introduction… changes everything.

01:21.833 --> 01:22.600
Orbit.

01:22.900 --> 01:24.600
Keep your people close.

01:24.933 --> 01:26.567
Try Orbit now.
